WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.950
LactoSync Owner App — a one-minute tour of the real app

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.450
Your dairy at a glance: today's litres for each shift, and every customer one search away.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:16.950
Every customer's month on one screen: daily deliveries on a calendar, this month's bill and pending dues.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:29.950
Orders and routes, sorted: adjust today's quantities, drag stops into delivery order, and see exactly what to load.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.450
Bills that build themselves: every invoice comes from the delivery log, with a daily order calendar customers can check.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:45.450
Payments in, receipts out: record cash or UPI, and the customer gets a receipt straight away.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:54.450
No more chasing dues: remind every overdue customer in one tap, and send notices to everyone or just one list.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.950
One app for billing, deliveries, payments and customers. Start free at lactosync.com
